Foliora NOTICE

Foliora is a provisional product codename. Name, trademark, domain, and package
availability are not cleared.

This repository contains no customer data or secrets. Builds use third-party
Rust and JavaScript dependencies under their respective licenses; a generated
release SBOM and complete dependency-license inventory remain mandatory before
distribution. Portable archive support uses the Rust `zip` ecosystem; desktop
clipboard integration uses `tauri-plugin-clipboard-manager` and `arboard`.

Noto Sans Regular is embedded through `ttf-noto-sans` 0.1.2 for searchable
Vietnamese/English PDF export. The font asset is Apache-2.0 licensed and has
SHA-256 F1CE78A25F519EF928B5B8755CA230314E47F8821E7AA89ECF000F033F389A9F.
Upstream crate: https://github.com/gifnksm/ttf-noto-sans

License boundary:
- Application, service, extension, desktop, and Rust crates: AGPL-3.0-or-later.
- Independent schema/protocol definitions and conformance samples: Apache-2.0.
- Brand assets require a separate usage policy before public launch.
